sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Trails Frontend
    participant API as REST Adapter
    participant Validator as Validation
    participant Mapper as DTO Mapper
    participant App as Application Service
    participant DB as Database Adapter
    participant MySQL

    User->>Frontend: Create or update Trails resource
    Frontend->>API: Send REST request
    API->>Validator: Validate request parameters and payload
    Validator-->>API: Validation result
    API->>Mapper: Convert DTO to domain input
    Mapper-->>API: Domain input
    API->>App: Execute use case
    App->>DB: Store or update resource
    DB->>MySQL: Persist entity changes
    MySQL-->>DB: Stored data
    DB-->>App: Domain result
    App-->>API: Use case result
    API-->>Frontend: HATEOAS response with links
    Frontend-->>User: Show updated resource
